# Wave 52 §E — Azorius Signet at priority. Its mana ability costs {1},{T}
# (`res/cardsfolder/a/azorius_signet.txt`, `Cost$ 1 T`), so before w52 the
# priority-time actionable set (`AvailableActions.cardHasActionable`) never named
# it: only a tap-only mana ability was offered. Three Islands pay the {1}, and
# Divination in hand keeps something castable, so this is also the "MAIN1 with
# something castable" shape for the Island tap → Undo → tap case (W10).
# Seat 1 (ai — an ordinary human-controlled seat) holds nothing.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Divination
humanbattlefield=Azorius Signet;Island;Island;Island
humanlibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Island
ailibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
aigraveyard=
